    "description": "StartFragment\n\n**Employee Wallet API \u2013 Postman Collection**\n\nThis Postman collection provides a complete test suite for the Employee Wallet backend assessment API.\n\nIt covers the full business workflow of the wallet platform, including employee management, wallet creation, internal fund transfers, payroll synchronization, asynchronous bank withdrawals, transaction history retrieval, and infrastructure health verification.\n\nEndFragment",
